{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced-trading","title":"高级交易","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/advanced-trading","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reinforcement-learning-trading","title":"强化学习在交易中的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/advanced-trading/reinforcement-learning-trading","wordCount":999,"readingTime":4},{"seq":2,"slug":"market-making","title":"做市策略与库存管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/advanced-trading/market-making","wordCount":1231,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"crypto-quant","title":"加密货币量化交易","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/advanced-trading/crypto-quant","wordCount":1162,"readingTime":5}],"introMarkdown":"# 高级交易\n\n高级交易探索算法交易领域的前沿方向和特殊市场。本章覆盖三个正在快速演进的领域：强化学习在交易中的应用将序列决策理论引入交易执行和策略优化，为传统方法提供了全新的建模视角；做市策略作为市场流动性的提供者，需要在价差收入与库存风险之间精细平衡；加密货币量化交易则面对 7×24 小时不间断运行、高波动率和独特的市场微观结构，既带来新机遇也引入传统市场中不存在的风险维度。\n"}